1.8 Complete System Diagram
The system architecture consists of:
React frontend application
Node.js/Express backend API
MongoDB database
AWS EC2 instances
AWS Application Load Balancer
AWS CloudWatch monitoring
GitHub repository and GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline
The frontend communicates with the backend APIs through HTTP requests. The backend interacts with MongoDB for data storage and retrieval. The application is deployed on two EC2 instances behind an AWS Application Load Balancer to improve reliability and availability.
