4.4 Functional Testing Analysis
The functional testing results demonstrate that the Devolenz Software License Management System successfully met all major functional requirements defined in the Software Requirements Specification (SRS). Authentication, authorization, license management, request workflows, and user management features operated correctly under different user scenarios.
The testing also verified that the system properly handled invalid operations such as duplicate assignments, duplicate registrations, and license allocation when no licenses were available. Role-based access control worked as expected by restricting administrative features from standard users.
Overall, the testing process confirmed that the application is stable, reliable, and capable of supporting the intended business operations without major functional issues.

